摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Local-first file conversion for DeepSeek Harness — images, PDF, data, audio/video & office docs. 7 tools, 26 conversions, no API keys, no uploads.","id":"gh:1350374273","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-file-convert","slug":"zzy-12345678/dsh-file-convert","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","ffmpeg","file-conversion","libreoffice","ocr"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Local-first file conversion for DeepSeek Harness — images, PDF, data, audio/video & office docs. 7 t"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ools, 26 conversions, no API keys, no uploads."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-file-convert"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Local-first file conversion for DeepSeek Harness.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Convert images, PDFs and data files directly inside your DSH agent sessions — no API keys, no upload"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"s, no servers, no token cost for the conversion itself. Files never leave your machine."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Unofficial community plugin.** Not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **Compatibility:** v1.1.x supports DeepSeek Harness Desktop **0.2.1-rc.5 and 0.2.2-rc.1** through "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"explicit peer-version branches, tested against separate runtime dependency graphs. The v1.0.x baseli"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ne remains available for 0.2.1-rc.5. Other hosts require separate verification. Node.js `^22.19.0 ||"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" >=24.0.0` is required. See installation, upgrades and rollback."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Agents constantly need file conversions: \"turn this PDF into images\", \"give me that JSON as YAML\", \""},{"id":"p8s2","text":"convert all JPGs in this folder to WebP\". Instead of shelling out or pasting data around, `dsh-file-"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"convert` gives your agent eight purpose-built tools backed by battle-tested local libraries."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- ✅ **Local execution** — files never leave the machine\n- ✅ **No API key, no server, no conversion t"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"okens**\n- ✅ **Natural language friendly** — the agent calls the tools, you just ask\n- ✅ **Batch conv"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ersions** with a compact summary\n- ✅ **Honest failures** — missing dependency, unsupported pair, exi"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"sting output: every error says exactly why\n- ✅ **Images, PDF and data need zero external binaries** "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"— prebuilt npm packages only. Media needs one tool (ffmpeg), clearly reported when missing"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Supported conversions"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Source | Targets |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| PNG, JPG, WEBP | PNG, JPG, WEBP (any-to-any) |\n| SVG | PNG, JPG, WEBP |\n| PDF | PNG, JPG, TXT |\n| "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"JSON | YAML, CSV |\n| YAML | JSON, CSV |\n| DOCX, PPTX, XLSX | PDF |\n| PDF | PNG, JPG, TXT, DOCX (expe"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"rimental); TXT supports OCR for scanned PDFs |\n| MP4 | GIF, MP3 |\n| MOV | MP4 |\n| WAV | MP3 |\n| CSV "},{"id":"p12s4","text":" supports OCR for scanned PDFs |\n| MP4 | GIF, MP3 |\n| MOV | MP4 |\n| WAV | MP3 |\n| CSV | JSON, YAML |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"26 conversions. Images, PDF and data work out of the box via `npm install`. Optional tools unlock th"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"e rest, each clearly reported by `list_conversions` when missing:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **FFmpeg** -> media rows. Install it system-wide (preferred for untrusted media), **or ask the age"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"nt to run `install_media_dependencies`** — it downloads pinned current builds (FFmpeg 6.1.1, ~56 MB "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"total, one time) into the plugin cache, sha256-verified, from the npmmirror binary CDN with the GitH"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ub release as fallback.\n- **LibreOffice** -> DOCX/PPTX/XLSX to PDF. `winget install TheDocumentFound"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ation.LibreOffice` / `brew install --cask libreoffice` / `apt install libreoffice`.\n- **Ghostscript*"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"* -> PDF compression in `optimize_file`.\n- **Python + pdf2docx** -> the experimental PDF to DOCX row"},{"id":"p14s7","text":" (`pip install pdf2docx`).\n- **Tesseract** (optional) -> faster OCR for scanned PDFs; without it the"},{"id":"p14s8","text":" bundled tesseract.js is used and its language data is fetched explicitly via `install_ocr_dependenc"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"ies` (`winget install UB-Mannheim.TesseractOCR`)."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Inside a DSH profile — three ways, easiest first:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Git installs may ask you to allow the build step in the profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml`:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> **First-install note**: pnpm may also ask you to decide on a build script for `tesseract.js` (it o"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"nly shows a donation notice — skipping is safe). Set it in the same file and re-run the install:\n>\n["},{"id":"p20s3","text":" donation notice — skipping is safe). Set it in the same file and re-run the install:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"From a local checkout (e.g. while hacking on it):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Then restart DSH (`dsh web` or your usual entry point). All eight tools appear automatically."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## The eight tools"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### `convert_file`"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Convert one file."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- Default output: next to the input file, same base name, new extension.\n- Multi-page PDFs produce `"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"<name>-<page>.<ext>` for every page; `pages: \"1-3,5\"` selects pages (outputs keep their real page nu"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"mbers, text joins only the selection).\n- Scanned PDFs → TXT: `ocr: true` (optionally `ocr_lang`, def"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"ault `chi_sim+eng`) recognizes the rendered pages instead of the text layer. Engine priority: a loca"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"l Tesseract CLI, then the bundled tesseract.js (whose language data is never downloaded implicitly —"},{"id":"p29s6","text":" run `install_ocr_dependencies` first, about 10-30 MB per language).\n- Existing outputs are refused "},{"id":"p29s7","text":"unless `overwrite: true`.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- **Declarative matrix**: every conversion is a data row (`{ from, to }`) on its converter. Routing,"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" `list_conversions` and dependency checks are all derived from it.\n- **Detection**: content first - "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"binary magic (file-type), SVG sniffing, and JSON parsing (plus a YAML document-marker guess for exte"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"nsion-less files) - with the extension as fallback. Conflicts resolve in favor of the content, with "},{"id":"p32s5","text":"a warning.\n- **Core is DSH-agnostic**: `src/core` never imports Cordis/DSH, so the engine can be uni"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"t-tested, wrapped in a CLI, or served over MCP later. If the DSH developer-preview API shifts, only "},{"id":"p32s7","text":"the glue layer changes.\n- **Dependencies**: external binaries (FFmpeg, LibreOffice, Poppler) are *de"},{"id":"p32s8","text":"tected, never auto-installed* — `list_conversions` reports them and prints per-platform install hint"},{"id":"p32s9","text":"s. The interface is already in place (`BinaryDependency`)."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Component | Verified version |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| DeepSeek Harness Desktop | 0.2.1-rc.5 |\n| DeepSeek Harness Desktop (additional baseline) | 0.2.2-r"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"c.1 |\n| @deepseek-ai/dsh-tools | `0.2.1-rc.5` or `0.2.2-rc.1`, matching the host |\n| @deepseek-ai/co"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"rdis | `4.0.5` (DSH 0.2.1-rc.5) or `4.1.0` (DSH 0.2.2-rc.1) |\n| @deepseek-ai/schemastery | 3.18.5 |\n"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"| Node.js | `^22.19.0 \\|\\| >=24.0.0` (CI covers 22 and Windows 24) |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The 1.0.x line keeps its original 0.2.1-rc.5 baseline; 1.1.x adds 0.2.2-rc.1 while retaining the old"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"er host. The complete old peer graph is built and tested separately with `npm run test:compat`; norm"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"al CI uses the new graph. The client injects the conversation package, which owns the view slot, wit"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"hout requesting retired framework packages. `defineTool` argument validation and host compatibility "},{"id":"p36s5","text":"checks remain enabled. Other DSH release candidates are not implicitly supported. See STABILITY.md."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
